#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:353
#: 026de3c4f6bb4bdc8606b58e1a10a803
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:355
#: fab48ac321404315adedbeed8c95e330
msgid ""
"The SBus input pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used"
" for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 "
"which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this"
" manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBus 输入引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外，这两种协议需要真正的 UART 连接。但以这种方式连接时，FPort 仅提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:357
#: 7c54b831b7e64d2f8494fe7f7a4bf568
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4 (UART8) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART4. "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"若要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL4 即 "
"UART8）进行接收机连接。以下为使用 UART4 的配置。:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为"
" 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:359
#: e747bc416a904db2a4a638f1f2d6bedd
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:361
#: aef875a5b9434034a8bbb048f11a06a3
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:363
#: d41f41dafa0d43108392dece9fc1a7bd
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the UART4 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，且仅连接 UART4 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:365
#: ce0916a0c0434992945fc9399f8ab4ac
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的任何 UART 也可用于遥控系统连接，且兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:368
#: 682d0f91dc9f4c8f9faa53eae8b9c58d
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:370
#: bca186c32d32400f9180f865b68543b3
msgid ""
"The PixPilot-V3 supports up to 14 PWM outputs. First first 8 outputs "
"(labelled S1 to S8) are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO controller. "
"These 8 outputs support all PWM output formats, but not DShot."
msgstr ""
"PixPilot-V3 支持最多 14 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（标为 S1 至 S8）由专用 STM32F103 IO 控制器控制，支持所有 "
"PWM 输出格式，但不支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:373
#: c872f12782f3481fa289fbf7ea5dfb75
msgid ""
"The remaining 6 outputs (labelled AUX1 to AUX6) are the \"auxiliary\" "
"outputs. These are directly attached to the STM32F427 and support all PWM "
"protocols as well as DShot."
msgstr "其余 6 路输出（标为 AUX1 至 AUX6）为「辅助」输出，直接连接到 STM32F427，支持所有 PWM 协议以及 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:377
#: 95af4ea4f24d4ce0b3cddf0fc4803a95
msgid ""
"All 14 PWM outputs have GND on the top row, 5V on the middle row and signal "
"on the bottom row."
msgstr "全部 14 路 PWM 输出的顶行为 GND，中行为 5V，底行为信号线。"

